{"title":"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Point\" title=\"Point\">points</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9eb460a33e48501fa9f1fca1b059f01099322dd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A(x_1, y_1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad4d2d69f1db146bc3f0aa7c92eab3e6ce35b93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B(x_2, y_2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> are chosen on the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Graph\" title=\"Graph\">graph</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/c/8ac437b09da7c98f3c56607086126fb55ef44f3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\ln x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/d/f9d24d4765b2ba34b600b5c0da91f9d3c497fe07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; x_1 &lt; x_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"92\" height=\"15\" />. The points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> trisect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/2/be20b1dbbd31212c5d1eda81c7c95eb798bc07ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC &lt; CB$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />. Through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> a horizontal <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">line</a> is drawn to cut the curve at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/0/ba0bb204ed937a5b3117b5146d206a6d6f7909cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E(x_3, y_3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" />. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/6/ee60922c5fc5ee1941df04f838cdae71fbc29d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd241834905de5246fcbb2444ed65f963fccbce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/a/3da890ccfccbece41de9ef2f8dea090a5f41a3b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2 = 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is the trisector of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line_segment\" title=\"Line segment\">line segment</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> closer to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is equal to two thirds the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> plus one third the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus, point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> has coordinates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/d/56d5ec7c682f05c9155caf3c758b733c6ebcdd23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x_0, \\frac{2}{3} \\ln 1 + \\frac{1}{3}\\ln 1000) = (x_0, \\ln 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"275\" height=\"37\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/f/17f1249ad95b7682b8316ad21de8ce4ee9fdcf93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />.  Then the horizontal <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Line\" title=\"Line\">line</a> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a24462603b8669a3495823a6dfc17ea3aaf31090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\ln 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"18\" />, and this intersects the curve <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/e/41e1b2946173db1032ec480af09b93bbfa309a3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\ln x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> at the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/7/ad7bdff1735a9ee96cc5d63aae817202ea309e92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(10, \\ln 10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/0/e0095903701ced2c2665ad37b2905672fb33a256.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 4 2006-2007</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=125025\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">Logarithm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Coordinate_geometry\" title=\"Coordinate geometry\">Coordinate geometry</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017130540\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 225/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1442/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 200/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5338/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.401      1 Template:Mock_AIME_box\n100.00%    7.401      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4412:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017130540 and revision id 17608. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}